{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"night-forest","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Night Forest","description":"Deep greens, moss and amber. Calm and low glare.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Night Forest","path":"themes/night-forest.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/night-forest.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Night Forest\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1b2420\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#d3ddd5\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#16201b\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#121a16\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#121a16\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#16201b\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#25332c\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#33493e\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#25332c\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#16201b\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#121a16\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#8fbf7f\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#8fbf7f\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#8fbf7f\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#33493e\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#25332c80\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#8fbf7f\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#121a16\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e58f7a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#8fbf7f\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#d9c58a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#e58f7a\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6b8576\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d9c58a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e0a074\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8fbf7f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7fbfb0\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a8d8a0\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e0a074\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b4cdbb\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e58f7a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d9c58a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7fbfb0\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Night Forest\n\nDeep greens, moss and amber. Calm and low glare.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Night Forest** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1b2420` |\n| Text | `#d3ddd5` |\n| Accent | `#8fbf7f` |\n| Keywords | `#8fbf7f` |\n| Strings | `#d9c58a` |\n| Functions | `#a8d8a0` |\n| Types | `#7fbfb0` |\n| Comments | `#6b8576` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}